IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0018.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY CRD0018C.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 C-LM               PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM SET-CARD-LIMIT
    DISPLAY "C-LM=" C-LM
    STOP RUN.
SET-CARD-LIMIT.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 1996
    *>  IF WS-CSCR >= 600
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    IF WS-CSCR >= 750
        COMPUTE C-LM = WS-ANINC * 0.25
    ELSE
        IF WS-CSCR >= 660
            COMPUTE C-LM ROUNDED = WS-ANINC * 0.15
        ELSE
            MOVE 1000 TO C-LM
        END-IF
    END-IF.
